  "bio": "Welcome to Absteige, Oldenburg's premiere destination for exceptional black & gray, realism, and tribal tattoo artistry. Nestled in the heart of Oldb., this avant-garde studio melds the raw energy of graffiti culture with the precision of tattoo craftsmanship. Drop by Tuesday to Friday from 11:00 to 18:30 or schedule your appointment online to experience a truly unique ink journey in Germany."
